    Bug 1872230 - Modernize nsMsgBodyHandler::GetNextFilterLine(). r=BenC


    - Prevent nsParseMailMessageState::ParseHeaders() from leaving data fragments in m_headers after shrinking the contents of a header by folding white space.
    - Make nsMsgBodyHandler::GetNextFilterLine() more robust in case of unexpectedly corrupted header data.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D210129

